#: 09_16P01
msgctxt "09_16P01"
msgid "Again?"
msgstr "Igen?"

#: 10_02N01
msgctxt "10_02N01"
msgid "Auf jeden Fall, Herr Ripley. Und where will you be traveling?"
msgstr "Auf jeden Fall, herr Ripley. Und vart ska ni resa?"

#: 10_02N02
msgctxt "10_02N02"
msgid "Auf jeden Fall, Herr Ripley."
msgstr "Auf jeden Fall, herr Ripley."

#: 10_02N05
msgctxt "10_02N05"
msgid "Auf Wiedersehen, Herr Ripley!"
msgstr "Auf Wiedersehen, herr Ripley!"

#: 10_02P01
msgctxt "10_02P01"
msgid "I'd like to book passage."
msgstr "Jag vill boka en biljett."

#: 10_02P02
msgctxt "10_02P02"
msgid "I'd like to send a parcel to New York."
msgstr "Jag vill skicka ett paket till New York."

#: 10_02P03
msgctxt "10_02P03"
msgid "I'd like to withdraw the money in my account."
msgstr "Jag vill ta ut pengarna på mitt konto."

#: 10_02P04
msgctxt "10_02P04"
msgid "I'd like to buy some marks."
msgstr "Jag vill köpa några mark."

#: 10_02P05
msgctxt "10_02P05"
msgid "Thank you, Horst. Goodbye."
msgstr "Tack, Horst. Adjö."

#: 10_03N01
msgctxt "10_03N01"
msgid "It will leave on the first plane out tomorrow."
msgstr "Det avgår med första flyget i morgon."

#: 10_04N01
msgctxt "10_04N01"
msgid "Auf jeden Fall, Herr Ripley. Sign here, please."
msgstr "Auf jeden Fall, herr Ripley. Skriv under här, tack."

#: 10_05N01
msgctxt "10_05N01"
msgid "Entschuldigen Sie, Herr Ripley, your account seems to be empty."
msgstr "Entschuldigen Sie, herr Ripley, ert konto verkar vara tomt."

#: 10_06N01
msgctxt "10_06N01"
msgid "Very good, Mein Herr. When will you be ready to leave?"
msgstr "Mycket bra, mein Herr. När är ni redo att resa?"

#: 10_06P01
msgctxt "10_06P01"
msgid "New York."
msgstr "New York."

#: 10_06P02
msgctxt "10_06P02"
msgid "PAY PING!"
msgstr "PAY PING!"

#: 10_06P03
msgctxt "10_06P03"
msgid "Peru."
msgstr "Peru."

#: 10_06P04
msgctxt "10_06P04"
msgid "SIKIM"
msgstr "SIKIM"

#: 10_07P01
msgctxt "10_07P01"
msgid "NOW!"
msgstr "NU!"

#: 10_07P02
msgctxt "10_07P02"
msgid "I'll let you know."
msgstr "Jag meddelar er."

#: 10_08N01
msgctxt "10_08N01"
msgid "Auf Wiedersehen!"
msgstr "Auf Wiedersehen!"

#: 10_10N01
msgctxt "10_10N01"
msgid ""
"Entschuldigen Sie, Herr Ripley. Your account is empty. Would you like to pay"
" in cash?"
msgstr ""
"Entschuldigen Sie, herr Ripley. Ert konto är tomt. Vill ni betala kontant?"

#: 10_10N02
msgctxt "10_10N02"
msgid "Auf Wiedersehen!"
msgstr "Auf Wiedersehen!"

#: 10_10P02
msgctxt "10_10P02"
msgid "Of course, of course!"
msgstr "Naturligtvis!"

#: 10_11N01
msgctxt "10_11N01"
msgid ""
"As I mentioned here, Ripley, your account is currently empty. Would you care"
" to pay in cash?"
msgstr ""
"Som jag nämnde, Ripley, är ert konto för närvarande tomt. Vill ni betala "
"kontant?"

#: 10_11N02
msgctxt "10_11N02"
msgid "Auf Wiedersehen!"
msgstr "Auf Wiedersehen!"

#: 10_15N01
msgctxt "10_15N01"
msgid "Jawohl, Herr Ripley."
msgstr "Jawohl, herr Ripley."

#: 10_15P01
msgctxt "10_15P01"
msgid "I'm ready to leave now, Horst."
msgstr "Jag är redo att resa nu, Horst."

#: 10_15P02
msgctxt "10_15P02"
msgid "Ah, better make it cash then."
msgstr "Åh, då är det bäst att betala kontant."

#: 10_16N01
msgctxt "10_16N01"
msgid "They are good here, Ripley."
msgstr "De är bra här, Ripley."

#: 10_16P01
msgctxt "10_16P01"
msgid "Change my mind."
msgstr "Jag har ändrat mig."

#: 11_01N01
msgctxt "11_01N01"
msgid "It is the damp. Almost a swamp is here."
msgstr "Det är fuktigt. Här är nästan som i en sumpmark."

#: 11_01N02
msgctxt "11_01N02"
msgid "You will have noticed unusual features?"
msgstr "Ni har väl lagt märke till ovanliga drag?"

#: 11_01N04
msgctxt "11_01N04"
msgid "Ja, mein Herr."
msgstr "Ja, mein Herr."

#: 11_01N05
msgctxt "11_01N05"
msgid "It is a long story, mein Herr."
msgstr "Det är en lång historia, mein Herr."

#: 11_01N06
msgctxt "11_01N06"
msgid "Yeah, he did. I carry it."
msgstr "Ja, det gjorde han. Jag bär den."

#: 11_01N07
msgctxt "11_01N07"
msgid "Perhaps I'll talk to you later, if I may."
msgstr "Kanske kan jag prata med dig senare, om jag får."

#: 11_01P01
msgctxt "11_01P01"
msgid "What a melancholy aspect this place presents."
msgstr "Vilken melankolisk prägel den här platsen har."

#: 11_01P02
msgctxt "11_01P02"
msgid "An impressive tomb the old baron rests in."
msgstr "En imponerande grav som den gamle baronen vilar i."

#: 11_01P03
msgctxt "11_01P03"
msgid "I've done scores of features on graves and tombs."
msgstr "Jag har gjort mängder av reportage om gravar och gravvalv."

#: 11_01P04
msgctxt "11_01P04"
msgid "Is that a bell near the door of the tomb?"
msgstr "Är det en klocka nära gravens dörr?"

#: 11_01P05
msgctxt "11_01P05"
msgid "Why on earth is there a bell on that tomb?"
msgstr "Varför i hela friden finns det en klocka på den där graven?"

#: 11_01P06
msgctxt "11_01P06"
msgid "Did the old baron ever speak of a key to a tomb?"
msgstr "Talade den gamle baronen någonsin om en nyckel till en grav?"

#: 11_01P07
msgctxt "11_01P07"
msgid "As you wish, my hair."
msgstr "Som ni vill, min herre."

#: 11_02N01
msgctxt "11_02N01"
msgid ""
"The gases rises up. There are stories I could tell you about the gases that "
"would make your hair curl."
msgstr ""
"Gaserna stiger upp. Jag skulle kunna berätta historier om gaserna som får "
"håret att resa sig på er."

#: 11_02P01
msgctxt "11_02P01"
msgid "Even in the daylight, the atmosphere is oppressive."
msgstr "Även i dagsljus är atmosfären tryckande."

#: 11_03P01
msgctxt "11_03P01"
msgid "I may take you up on that."
msgstr "Jag kanske tar er på orden."

#: 11_04P01
msgctxt "11_04P01"
msgid "Yeah, and my wallet flattened."
msgstr "Ja och min plånbok blev plattare."

#: 11_05N01
msgctxt "11_05N01"
msgid ""
"Examine carefully. There is a story in that tomb resting with the Baron."
msgstr ""
"Undersök noga. Det finns en historia i den där graven där baronen vilar."

#: 11_05P01
msgctxt "11_05P01"
msgid "Can't say that I have."
msgstr "Det kan jag inte säga att jag har."

#: 11_06N03
msgctxt "11_06N03"
msgid ""
"Mind hair. I am a busy man with many duties. I have no time for worthless "
"conversation."
msgstr ""
"Hör här. Jag är en upptagen man med många plikter. Jag har inte tid med "
"meningslösa samtal."
